                <l xml:id="m-316e327c-db2d-40c6-a953-a185a97b74a9" facs="#m-7db31a85-d9d7-4da8-84e6-b19f662c4ad4" label="ambiguous">776MM</l><l xml:id="m-6773cd34-e4aa-4781-9352-0de51f985cb2" facs="#m-7f035c4b-3b10-4000-a59c-c85e57f18c02" label="text-like">For Lauds</l><l xml:id="m-1cc9cff2-446e-431e-a42c-a44efa05c5ff" facs="#m-6f14d938-54c1-4728-9576-4635da0da106" label="text-like">The Messiah-Saviour (1-8) and his</l><l xml:id="m-f3ecd01a-155a-4167-9eff-4e09abeb214a" facs="#m-5898fb9b-d599-40d8-82ad-d22f765d784a" label="ambiguous">precursor (9-12)</l><l xml:id="m-cc3fc026-b2f6-4e8b-940a-63772e6da285" facs="#m-3a850eff-379a-4062-9d6f-6308226e8e6b" label="lyrics-like">I. quia visitávit et fécit redemptiónem</l><l xml:id="m-9db4d08f-b60f-42a1-92e9-9ee7212438ff" facs="#m-61db292b-4051-4a9a-a4bb-31d02254bca2" label="lyrics-like">plé- bis</l><l xml:id="m-480af36f-532a-4e9b-b11b-bc4e0751c593" facs="#m-4f4290c3-ab1e-4c83-ba4e-15d2a37914ef" label="lyrics-like">sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-21fa3cf1-22d0-4808-a4e9-5324a8cd1599" facs="#m-d2b2f143-addb-4370-8c68-769da33d6b5f" label="ambiguous">ae.</l><l xml:id="m-9a1f7122-4ab9-4a18-b3bc-40b6bbbf827e" facs="#m-6deb03a1-a9b0-47bb-a7b5-39d4739eb051" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-f175a143-ad71-4d73-93fc-075304cb8cb2" facs="#m-afe26309-168f-4c4c-82da-97e599bdc5fa" label="lyrics-like">2. in dómo Dávid pú¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d9670d1-d584-47c5-ae18-eceaa1b5166f" facs="#m-aba10c22-8dc2-4344-b49f-f051c07f8ffa" label="lyrics-like">sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-da6d5132-a09f-45e9-bbc7-21bdd1a14687" facs="#m-195da6de-d279-402a-a443-8a5cb77627d3" label="ambiguous">e- ri</l><l xml:id="m-c19df317-bd18-4548-88f5-e5b816d071cf" facs="#m-73d084c0-3bd4-4098-9422-2340cf284985" label="lyrics-like">3. qui a saéculo sunt, prophe¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b38ceaf-84e2-420b-b6fb-3e5676bba2f1" facs="#m-8e3a7f24-f429-4ac9-8ab9-8ed83f52602e" label="ambiguous">jus:</l><l xml:id="m-a3f67fa3-a906-4701-b057-37f29665b78f" facs="#m-9070db47-dcbb-4dcb-a482-fbd62b7f5ac9" label="lyrics-like">tá- rum é¬</l><l xml:id="m-745bf2e8-c8ac-490d-ae74-f7dccf6fb8b9" facs="#m-106b881b-60c5-4158-ae31-8797aad33881" label="lyrics-like">4. et de mánu ómnium</l><l xml:id="m-bd92c4ec-cb6c-47d9-9cd1-1ed58c033370" facs="#m-f3c40ffd-e3af-4925-a357-5f818c0eb8f2" label="lyrics-like">dé-runt nos:</l><l xml:id="m-96088cf7-717a-4295-840b-79db667eb3f2" facs="#m-6cd469a5-fb9c-4da5-87c2-690691717738" label="ambiguous">qui o¬</l><l xml:id="m-a284fda0-e0ea-4d05-baed-e2ef0f896eeb" facs="#m-5b89062b-c5e4-4e51-a46b-ea64960b023f" label="lyrics-like">sú¬ i</l><l xml:id="m-2f6959cb-17cd-465a-9ecc-f20b10bd24c7" facs="#m-e4b30cf0-9c9f-4645-bd97-60636beb225a" label="lyrics-like">5. et memorári testaménti</l><l xml:id="m-2d1f231b-7e8e-499a-ac24-9740a2cdb8df" facs="#m-d9131be5-973f-462e-be6d-fc865d221fcf" label="ambiguous">cti.</l><l xml:id="m-c5dd463d-4e5c-41a8-9007-044541b09ad4" facs="#m-2998042e-a09b-48f4-878b-879d350782ff" label="lyrics-like">sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb7b797e-7a0e-4261-beba-3a231856308f" facs="#m-e482f6e3-24de-43e5-b2ed-51ab81e7d92e" label="lyrics-like">6. datú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0bca2db2-8338-442f-b66a-24634d850a6b" facs="#m-e8bcf79e-fe4f-4a2b-bc44-a39296e130f1" label="lyrics-like">nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-200c8822-63df-40bd-80e4-dd18696b997d" facs="#m-b8c569aa-7622-44e1-bd79-da321dd841fd" label="ambiguous">bis:</l><l xml:id="m-7fb2f477-80ce-40e5-93ad-f5aa07a0bc64" facs="#m-6a194c30-b786-40df-a883-9b62b628c2fa" label="ambiguous">rum se</l><l xml:id="m-303fe37f-6e19-4d60-a14f-cea1223d9537" facs="#m-d447d5a4-be31-45a3-8cf8-61207d351569" label="ambiguous">li:</l><l xml:id="m-ab67a108-9124-4e9c-887f-f7d7a29301ea" facs="#m-c0b9b1fb-2b5a-44fa-acde-216daaf609f6" label="ambiguous">7. servi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3565dc2d-8939-44d1-9c2c-a3bf779add17" facs="#m-fff4e025-8135-43a3-889f-ce01953c7081" label="lyrics-like">á- mus fl¬</l><l xml:id="m-c11a4d16-b8f7-4cc5-9581-c6621b69eee0" facs="#m-529073ae-6b21-4cc3-acc5-67010380ace5" label="lyrics-like">8. ómnibus di¬</l><l xml:id="m-86f0fef3-0ded-41f4-8a74-fa050632f7a2" facs="#m-9895cfa9-524e-4cd2-8433-1deb4d9f9b5e" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-b598cedc-6d79-48d8-b457-24a5ae3c9a2e" facs="#m-7261f90c-9c36-43ab-86ca-526ef8555403" label="ambiguous">stris.</l><l xml:id="m-385f4168-3a89-45cb-8ce9-00967c0d9712" facs="#m-2fde70de-eded-4321-927f-e755956cc83f" label="ambiguous">bus</l><l xml:id="m-6d904555-fbab-4ccd-a047-48f3b4132772" facs="#m-ed34c6cc-a637-4b41-9008-b494b372707c" label="lyrics-like">nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb063e42-86a4-49c2-b31d-cf7812b10bb2" facs="#m-3d2be266-5d41-4669-bcb8-f0b2ce1588e4" label="lyrics-like">9. praeíbis enim ante fáciem Dómini paráre</l><l xml:id="m-bed44c2c-07d9-4905-90e5-2d65976a74af" facs="#m-6da4f013-e696-4695-a4ed-fa9553c63c4c" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-5de02f3e-38d0-471e-b14d-87e5e1b8f78f" facs="#m-8b4b48c5-c4d4-4871-b830-cece273c1162" label="ambiguous">vi¬ as</l><l xml:id="m-1c317090-20d5-4503-92a6-e7187ae8c546" facs="#m-1ca6c391-f1fa-4c55-8794-5d3196d08642" label="ambiguous">jus:</l><l xml:id="m-bb511813-bea6-4eb2-ae6f-6133782d4e06" facs="#m-42d2a2b2-027e-4171-8f64-6cfeace037c2" label="lyrics-like">ó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c43cd6af-f2c2-4f00-9467-a70849175750" facs="#m-b3d89a00-c5d4-4020-8def-8861e1255d47" label="lyrics-like">10. in remissiónem peccató¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ccb3848-b8a5-4afd-9b9c-5d61eafcb9ef" facs="#m-5762fc99-85f7-45f4-949c-20ad8c9cfc91" label="ambiguous">rum:</l><l xml:id="m-a9c2e064-23b9-4046-a53c-f076d39c124e" facs="#m-dcf099b2-9a1e-49ee-a96e-850832cd7490" label="ambiguous">rum e¬</l><l xml:id="m-00d20762-c9a8-48f1-a26a-4dc7721d6bb7" facs="#m-4040a05a-eb8e-45cc-acb8-0362ba380efb" label="lyrics-like">1l. in quibus visitávit nos, óri¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7957fd7-329a-42c8-9c4d-057b170a1c5a" facs="#m-6b8201a1-1195-4bf6-9c6f-f689663d0969" label="lyrics-like">ens ex ál¬</l><l xml:id="m-c6d78ac7-3222-4e4f-87af-5851583a96bf" facs="#m-eabc5c49-9428-4efd-b696-8819f802a6d7" label="ambiguous">to:</l><l xml:id="m-87f85684-824c-4d78-8d57-67c237ba2603" facs="#m-ad146ff8-8038-416f-a4d2-d82095aab6c6" label="lyrics-like">12. ad dirigéndos pédes nóstros in</l><l xml:id="m-59d793ea-7973-4c6c-b78f-2d0bb76a2f52" facs="#m-a967f0fc-14d9-49a2-a902-0a39da4c898e" label="lyrics-like">pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d531aeb-486b-4de7-9cf2-b40958146715" facs="#m-8857ecb2-b82d-46a9-a562-fdc0d6397fe7" label="ambiguous">cis.</l><l xml:id="m-2e146e3d-80d1-4c71-a53b-ea13d1406ffd" facs="#m-4dce118c-8f5d-47b3-8408-f6f02641e457" label="ambiguous">vi- am</l><l xml:id="m-929c7937-c0ef-4626-8349-c0d297762b1f" facs="#m-7004a2d0-e16d-45ac-8ef0-0116f339f879" label="lyrics-like">Sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-05b00fa2-1eee-4ca5-8d69-3b7a2c28feaa" facs="#m-9e03a794-3058-4c60-a754-917d10de5611" label="ambiguous">13. et Spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c2e167c-7b61-4c08-b245-86fc5124718f" facs="#m-d12da969-5449-4112-95fc-4adc940ae1f5" label="ambiguous">tu¬ i</l><l xml:id="m-5b046a9e-983f-4a2e-8c0d-6a8eb457fd66" facs="#m-bf55cc8d-7a2d-49ac-bc84-155bd1aaec4e" label="ambiguous">cto.</l><l xml:id="m-f14ef2e2-3887-41fc-bf3e-358e0a02f8a3" facs="#m-945659a5-af4d-4af7-a52b-b15e408e5fb9" label="lyrics-like">14. et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d29e1761-0ca6-494f-834d-1e65ecbc6818" facs="#m-3ca6cde6-a8a6-490d-aa28-c52587e5caea" label="lyrics-like">ló- rum. A¬</l><l xml:id="m-1db1fb8f-cbcd-43ed-b4ed-d4a18e769d0e" facs="#m-5d167c5d-e862-4cee-8930-21ae7e663f12" label="ambiguous">men.</l><l xml:id="m-59ff5757-3965-4be4-8dcc-31c8cf058ede" facs="#m-be6bd1d1-3f81-4873-8d94-f8edcae7e74e" label="text-like">10. Then the celebrant sings:</l><l xml:id="m-5b76fa8f-63e0-4cda-b1ca-8c2884f7b914" facs="#m-237b1cf0-467b-4f3c-9a05-7df31b425002" label="lyrics-like">F. Dóminus vobíscum.</l><l xml:id="m-5c8b5f48-d6d9-4488-94ea-5490fe57c4e7" facs="#m-a4be3c04-b2e4-4e3d-8574-dbb3d918e490" label="lyrics-like">K. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-4ac70e85-d363-462e-a644-5bea9471a3e9" facs="#m-283bb075-e668-4f07-b264-87fdef87dfee" label="text-like">The deacon Ior the priestl turns towards the pe</l><l xml:id="m-64edef2c-9f2b-4838-987e-520f777cf4fa" facs="#m-887fd1b1-541d-4c45-8902-f271af224c96" label="text-like">cople and sings:</l><l xml:id="m-b89638d1-4e38-4e75-b7cf-12cd66346140" facs="#m-ee771e88-db8c-4e30-958e-e0fe367b46da" label="lyrics-like">Ite míssa est, alle-lú-ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb6e5ef3-127a-436a-8b8d-c66cac8c6b69" facs="#m-92ed1b58-02e4-4a35-8d56-114bb827a0b0" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-1816bf36-b40d-4c6d-bf70-357f3f3a8d7b" facs="#m-e4b8bcd2-5c52-4179-b262-b0de0a5acfbe" label="lyrics-like">Dé-o grá-ti-as, alle-lú-ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a0406c6-6bc0-4538-944e-5e73b457d76f" facs="#m-3406c90e-d770-4137-91a7-de822a5443d3" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-62985877-502c-49b3-b87b-9e80ffe6c96d" facs="#m-b6ae7289-ae2b-4ca9-b8ee-983fa53b7873" label="lyrics-like">After saying Pláceat tibi, sancta Trinitas th</l><l xml:id="m-d6e098b7-1333-4e6b-80e3-49f0bc843fc2" facs="#m-c65cb3ea-934b-493a-9b65-e91abab90db7" label="text-like">ecelebrant gives the blessins</l><l xml:id="m-7f7a8436-9734-4450-94d0-35313053ac98" facs="#m-643949c4-510a-4797-95c4-cb4ca36307ba" label="text-like">u ihe usual ua. Tne Last dospel is omirted, an</l><l xml:id="m-14e2ee02-2e9f-4c39-87e4-5ba0ebc26f87" facs="#m-1b84d817-96ce-461c-8679-da811af56692" label="text-like">d all return to the sacristo.</l><l xml:id="m-b564b9b8-0766-4649-a0a5-79c9c52cb4b4" facs="#m-d0b3b009-af3d-445d-ad57-bfbedcf05d21" label="text-like">At a convenient time, the Blessed Sacrament re</l><l xml:id="m-dc73c306-79b6-433c-bb41-c0d260a7f75f" facs="#m-2420340d-7db8-4790-b4f8-36018c373cbf" label="text-like">eserved for the sich is brought</l><l xml:id="m-6a9ef082-c8a9-405c-b80d-b4c6c67dbd36" facs="#m-eaaf6cf3-9264-48ef-86c0-c5218f426404" label="text-like">back to the altar.</l><l xml:id="m-bd39d7da-921d-4dfa-b8fb-e2c3187aa431" facs="#m-7d4f650f-b608-49e8-9d00-a980168d017f" label="text-like">The paschal candle remains on its stand, and si</l><l xml:id="m-2a036b09-c23f-4bab-9498-bec64be6b120" facs="#m-be808dfe-1b4a-44d7-9823-44093525052a" label="text-like">hould be lit at sung Mass and</l><l xml:id="m-cc887aa3-fa6b-451c-8c9f-c0582a0fa8cc" facs="#m-20a499e7-bf84-489f-a95a-ca35deaa2b26" label="text-like">Vespers. Ir may however also be lit at lou.</l><l xml:id="m-62f18ebd-e4ae-4955-a600-a4d38f18afa1" facs="#m-4e91e194-844f-4d51-a751-7c12be95119c" label="ambiguous">Masses celebrated' uith some</l><l xml:id="m-7daebdb7-aabc-41ac-810e-1acd30718751" facs="#m-7699f46b-8c0b-4cc2-a7e1-81472b5ccd36" label="text-like">solemity and other liturgical functions. It ren</l><l xml:id="m-9007bb99-904a-45d7-822a-8f502fe68760" facs="#m-9729aaa8-515d-4dea-a661-3c4cea5009c2" label="text-like">tains in place until the Mass</l><l xml:id="m-c0313b4c-679d-425e-8607-4d6431346f30" facs="#m-820cc18b-0f5e-411d-9928-8effd379d3eb" label="text-like">of the Ascension; vohen the Gospel of that Mass</l><l xml:id="m-4d27d471-475d-437b-b5f7-7168f5f1ee7c" facs="#m-df9557d4-4dd3-40b8-bf2a-139489be615d" label="text-like">is ended, it is extinguished;</l><l xml:id="m-d689f86c-97b8-4ba9-b7d3-eef3123ae1de" facs="#m-5ff0de94-d0ee-4392-97ec-78546794c228" label="text-like">and afterwards the candle and its stand are removed.</l><l xml:id="m-a5521e39-9cdf-4dea-8fd4-0151302a1839" facs="#m-ac85f92e-8c7e-4f49-8b0f-7477b37f4e79" label="ambiguous">N° Sol. — 31</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
